  "workingTreeSourceFilesMatch": true,
  "findings": {
    "P1": "All same-remote-Session Turns require terminal persistence receipts before deletion; artifact/R2 pending state retains source. Durable no-input-attempt proof is the sole exception; missing legacy flag does not qualify. Resource-closed records still recover checkpoints.",
    "P2": "Scope-verified original-binding deletion intent persists before DELETE; ACK and absence evidence are separate. Restart reads the original Session reference without requiring another DELETE. Intent-owner reuse and atomic sibling closure cover interrupted multi-Turn cleanup."
  },
